, "location": 2, "content": "会出现拉不动枪的情况", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 37.58, "to": 40.7, "sid": 21, "location": 2, "content": "这是因为拉枪阶段只使用了手腕移动鼠标", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 40.7, "to": 42.9, "sid": 22, "location": 2, "content": "导致微调时手腕会卡住", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 42.9, "to": 43.6, "sid": 23, "location": 2, "content": "动不了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 43.6, "to": 45.64, "sid": 24, "location": 2, "content": "如果只是用手腕移动鼠标", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 45.64, "to": 47.18, "sid": 25, "location": 2, "content": "移动空间会大大受限", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 47.18, "to": 49.38, "sid": 26, "location": 2, "content": "正确做法是以手臂为主", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 49.38, "to": 51.54, "sid": 27, "location": 2, "content": "去做视角转动和大幅度拉枪", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 51.54, "to": 53.6, "sid": 28, "location": 2, "content": "在一次定位后执行微调时", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 53.6, "to": 55.66, "sid": 29, "location": 2, "content": "才使用手腕做好鼠标复位", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 55.66, "to": 58.3, "sid": 30, "location": 2, "content": "也能使鼠标移动空间更大", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 58.3, "to": 60.56, "sid": 31, "location": 2, "content": "视角转动和一次定位更灵活", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 60.56, "to": 62.42, "sid": 32, "location": 2, "content": "新手出现无脑摆设的情况", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 62.42, "to": 65.0, "sid": 33, "location": 2, "content": "大多数原因都是搞错了微调的概念", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 65.0, "to": 66.84, "sid": 34, "location": 2, "content": "误认为微调是二次定位", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 66.84, "to": 68.38, "sid": 35, "location": 2, "content": "对枪时会下意识摆设", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 68.38, "to": 69.84, "sid": 36, "location": 2, "content": "不管第一枪有没有命中", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 69.84, "to": 71.72, "sid": 37, "location": 2, "content": "敌人在开枪后就会移动", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 71.72, "to": 72.62, "sid": 38, "location": 2, "content": "再次射击", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 72.62, "to": 74.76, "sid": 39, "location": 2, "content": "这样会使击杀窗口期拉长", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 74.76, "to": 77.0, "sid": 40, "location": 2, "content": "让对手获得击杀你的机会", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 77.0, "to": 79.48, "sid": 41, "locatio